/**
 * Extracts raw HTML blocks from the source before block parsing.
 *
 * Block level HTML found at the start of a line is pulled out verbatim and
 * replaced by a stash placeholder. Inline level HTML is left alone so the
 * inline pass can deal with it. Elements carrying a `markdown` attribute have
 * only their tags stashed, which lets their content flow through the normal
 * markdown pipeline.
